message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "SparkHolo Coherence Agent"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Brisson"
    given-names: "Jean-François"
    affiliation: "Spark AI NLP"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-9778-5374"
version: "0.2.0"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/sparkainlp-x/sparkholo-coherence-agent"
url: "https://sparkainlpx.xyz"
abstract: >-
  Streamlit research prototype that generates seeded synthetic multi-channel
  signals, computes Welch relative band power, dominant band and mean alpha
  coherence, asks NVIDIA Nemotron (via Nebius Token Factory) for a structured
  explanation, and independently re-computes every claim before display. Any
  failed, unbacked, malformed or clinically worded explanation is withheld
  (fail-closed). Synthetic data only; non-diagnostic; not a medical device; no
  health, therapeutic or clinical claims.
keywords:
  - nvidia
  - nemotron
  - nebius
  - streamlit
  - accountable-ai
  - synthetic-data
  - open-science
